   175	   `(z0^2, z0z1, z1^3)`". At `N = 2` the true value is `2` and the formula
   176	   gives `0`; the identity holds for `N >= 3 = max_j m_j`. Files:
   177	   `seed/.../report.md` Sect. 7; the value is visible in
   178	   `seed/.../numerics/task3_out.txt`, block "(b) monomial", row `N=2`
   179	   (`||H_N|| = 2`). `check_task3_gaps.py` and `check_task3c_exact.py` test the
   180	   identity for `N >= 3` and say so.
