  3958	   number).** The north star demands beating the BEST classical algorithm; C-087 names it
  3959	   (Monte Carlo on `V` by random slicing plus homotopy continuation) and this pair is the
  3960	   only row that would let the two costs be compared. A critic must recompute, on one
